design.tests:
Offline / unit (pure Config and service mocks):
- Learn rejects:
  - level 4;
  - gold 99;
  - wrong class id;
  - unknown id or a non-string id;
  - extra args;
  - distance 13;
  - NPC missing or a lookalike without the HHC attribute;
  - dead player;
  - already learned (no charge).
- Learn accepts exactly once on double fire.
- Gold is taken from the pocket first, then the bank.
- DataService sanitizer drops unknown ids and bad values.
- An old save with no Skills loads as {} and Q still works.
- UseSkill rejects: slot "Q" / nil / table / "Y"; not learned; another class's skill; MP below cost (cooldown NOT started); during the 0.5 s gap; during the slot cooldown. Z and Q cooldowns are independent.
- Mage Z with no target makes no MP spend and returns the 대상이 없어요 reason.
- Line geometry: a monster behind the player or 1 stud outside the width is not hit; the line end at 18/40 is inclusive.
- PvP budget:
  - Q+Z at the same victim within 3 s stays at or below 35% MaxHealth;
  - after 3 s the budget is full again;
  - two attackers each have their own budget;
  - Active kaiju is capped at 8%;
  - Neutral and rookies are never hit;
  - an auto cast never hits a player.
- Released payload:
  - Auto=false with MonstersHit≥1 counts for M1-3 / M2-5;
  - auto casts do not count;
  - _skillBy is set by Z, so a slime killed by Z fails S0 trial ①;
  - Halo heal is listed in Healed.
- Class change: SkillZ is cleared and the learned record is kept; switching back restores it.
- Rebirth keeps Learned (per decision 7).

Studio (the running place, not just files):
- New save: reach Lv5 (record the minute) → next-goal line → NPC E prompt → panel → learn → Z button appears → use it on PC (Z key), phone emulator (tap) and gamepad (L1). Check facing turn, Fx and the damage numbers.
- Auto ON after S0: Q→Z order, no player hits, no casts in town.
- Phone 749x361: no overlap of Z with jump / joystick / square row / quest overlay; touch target at least 44 px.
- R15 and R6 avatars.
- Relog keeps the learned skill (DataStore).
- 3-client test: Halo heal from Z, Horns drain, PvP budget in 고블린 숲 between non-rookies, Neutral immune.
- py tools/luau_check.py on HUD / Fx / CombatService (200-locals limit).

